{"id":"n88045-3-8","stage":3,"title":"펼치다 · 展示","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88045-3-8-1","ko":"오늘 네가 펼친 무대는 정말 최고였어!","zh":"你今天表演的舞台真的太棒了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"펼친","meaning":"展示，展现","explanation":"펼치다：展示，展现；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"펼치다","audio":"/audio/78ef364310c87c95d42e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88045","senseId":"3","lemma":"펼치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"펼친","audio":"/audio/f9e76be45a13a57166a0.mp3"}},{"text":"무대는","meaning":"舞台，活动领域","explanation":"무대：舞台，活动领域；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"무대","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15524","senseId":"2","lemma":"무대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무대는","audio":"/audio/4f86c156827d71e1c926.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"최고였어!","meaning":"最；最佳","explanation":"최고：最；最佳；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"최고","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47976","senseId":"1","lemma":"최고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"최고였어","audio":"/audio/46d76672775beb490d37.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"78ef364310c87c95","term":"펼치다","zh":"展示，展现","audio":"/audio/78ef364310c87c95d42e.mp3","entryId":"88045","definition":"为了让人看、听或享受而在人前表现出能吸引注意的状态。","pronunciation":["펼치다"]},{"id":"64389d2db12c00f1","term":"무대","zh":"舞台，活动领域","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3","entryId":"15524","definition":"(喻义)主要活动的场所或领域。","pronunciation":["무ː대"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"97b8be84b3d009c4","term":"최고","zh":"最；最佳","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3","entryId":"47976","definition":"最好或最出色的。","pronunciation":["최ː고","췌ː고"]}],"audio":"/audio/d452f93948f702506d57.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88045-3-8-2","ko":"고마워. 마지막 공연이어서 더 열심히 임했거든.","zh":"谢谢。因为这是最后一场演出，所以我更加努力地表演了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고마워.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고마워","audio":"/audio/e9e8361d4662874097d3.mp3"}},{"text":"마지막","meaning":"最后，最终，末了","explanation":"마지막：最后，最终，末了","readings":[{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28843","senseId":"1","lemma":"마지막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}},{"text":"공연이어서","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공연이어서","audio":"/audio/fd223ab5d18c6a066e7d.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"임했거든.","meaning":"担任","explanation":"임하다：担任；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"임하다","audio":"/audio/6dc3e88a80457d4b72b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73289","senseId":"1","lemma":"임하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"임했거든","audio":"/audio/5ef43496ccc320a3ef68.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"8da62ef6312ba9ce","term":"마지막","zh":"最后，最终，末了","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3","entryId":"28843","definition":"在时间上或次序上的末尾。","pronunciation":["마지막"]},{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"5be015e332c130d8","term":"열심히","zh":"认真地","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3","entryId":"67512","definition":"对于某事专心诚意地。","pronunciation":["열씸히"]},{"id":"6dc3e88a80457d4b","term":"임하다","zh":"担任","audio":"/audio/6dc3e88a80457d4b72b1.mp3","entryId":"73289","definition":"负责某件事或职位，作为自己的工作。","pronunciation":["임ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/782f27d22205f78c22db.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.082,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88045","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":107,"sequenceScore":2.8073,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你今天表演的舞台真的太棒了！","谢谢。因为这是最后一场演出，所以我更加努力地表演了。","我觉得我今天的面试表现得不错，感觉挺好的。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你今天表演的舞台真的太棒了！","谢谢。因为这是最后一场演出，所以我更加努力地表演了。","我觉得我今天的面试表现得不错，感觉挺好的。"],"answer":1}]}
